      "claim": "MicroAGI post-trained Cosmos 3 on human manipulation videos and distilled a 32-billion-parameter reasoner down to an 8-billion-parameter Nano model without losing accuracy.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/cosmos-open-train-evaluate-deploy-world-models",
      "excerpt": "post-trained Cosmos 3 on videos of humans manipulating objects and distilled its 32-billion-parameter reasoner down to an 8-billion-parameter Nano model with no loss in accuracy."
